  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il remonte sa peau jusqu’à son cou pour\nse protéger. Elle a une constitution\nélastique qui absorbe les coups.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its skin has a rubbery elasticity, so\nit can reduce damage by defensively\npulling its skin up to its neck.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quiconque a le malheur de croiser son\nregard se prend un coup de tête.\nIl a le crâne très dur.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It immediately headbutts anyone that\nmakes eye contact with it. Its skull is\nmassively thick.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Proud of its sturdy skull,\nit suddenly headbutts everything,\nbut its weight makes it unstable, too.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/21/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Proud of its sturdy skull,\nit suddenly headbutts everything,\nbut its weight makes it unstable, too.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "かわを　くびまで　ひきあげて\nぼうぎょの　しせい。ゴムのような\nだんりょくで　ダメージを　へらす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "가죽을 목까지 늘려서\n방어 자세를 취한다. 고무 같은\n탄력을 이용해 데미지를 줄인다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il remonte sa peau jusqu’à son cou pour se protéger.\nElle a une constitution élastique qui absorbe les\ncoups.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es zieht seine gummiartige Haut bis zum Hals hinauf\nund nimmt eine Abwehrhaltung ein, um sich vor\nSchaden zu schützen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se sube la piel hasta el cuello para defenderse. Su\nelasticidad, similar a la de una goma, reduce el daño\nrecibido.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Assumono la posizione difensiva tirando su fino al\ncollo la pelle, che è elastica come la gomma e\npreviene i danni.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its skin has a rubbery elasticity, so it can reduce\ndamage by defensively pulling its skin up to\nits neck.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "皮を　首まで　引き上げて\n防御の　姿勢。ゴムのような　弾力で\nダメージを　減らす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se sube la piel hasta el cuello para defenderse. Su\nelasticidad, similar a la de una goma, reduce el daño\nrecibido.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "がんじょうな　ずがいこつが　じまん。\nいきなり　ずつきを　かましてくるが\nおもさで　じぶんも　フラフラしてる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "튼튼한 두개골이 자랑이다.\n느닷없이 박치기를 하려고 하지만\n무게로 자신도 휘청거린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ses coups de tête sont sa fierté. Seul problème :\nsa tête est un peu trop lourde, et il perd souvent\nl’équilibre.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Verteilt gerne unvermittelt Kopfnüsse, deren Wucht\nauch seine Sinne vernebelt. Es ist stolz auf seinen\nrobusten Schädel.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Está orgulloso de su sólido cráneo. Reparte cabezazos\na diestro y siniestro con tal vehemencia que él mismo\nse marea.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Va fiero del suo robustissimo cranio. Tira senza\npreavviso testate così forti da farlo barcollare.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Proud of its sturdy skull, it suddenly headbutts\neverything, but its weight makes it unstable, too.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
